    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-iudic2">
        <head xml:id="gom-iudic2-Hd1e98">Caput 2</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-iudic2-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-iudic2-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-iudic2-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-iudic2-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/iudic2_1@1-2">Ascenditque angelus.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-iudic2-Rd1e109"><name xml:id="gom-iudic2-Nd1e110" ref="#Augustine">AUG.</name>, quaest. 12 in Jud.</ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-iudic2-Qd1e114"><seg type="qs">Et ascendit angelus Domini</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">quod ibi praeoccupando memoravit.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-iudic2-Dd1e123">
          <head xml:id="gom-iudic2-Hd1e125">Versus 3</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-iudic2-d1e127">
            <quote xml:id="gom-iudic2-Qd1e129" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/iudic2_3@4-5">Quamobrem nolui delere.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-iudic2-Rd1e132"><name xml:id="gom-iudic2-Nd1e133" ref="#Augustine">AUG.</name>, quaest. 13 in Jud.</ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-iudic2-Qd1e137">Hinc intelligimus quaedam ex ira Dei venire peccata. Ut enim dii gentium, inter quas <pb ed="#P" n="0522B"/> non exterminatas Israelitae habitare voluerunt, essent eis in scandalum, id est, facerent eos scandalizari in Deo suo, eoque offenso vivere, indignans comminatus est Deus, quod manifestum est, magnum esse peccatum.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-iudic2-Dd1e144">
          <head xml:id="gom-iudic2-Hd1e146">Versus 6</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-iudic2-d1e148">
            <quote xml:id="gom-iudic2-Qd1e150" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/iudic2_6@1-3">Dimisit ergo Josue.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-iudic2-Rd1e153"><name xml:id="gom-iudic2-Nd1e154" ref="#Augustine">AUG.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-iudic2-Qd1e157">Hoc per recapitulationem iteratur. Nam et mors Jesu Nave in hoc libro memoratur, ut tanquam ab exordio breviter cuncta insinuentur, ex quo dedit eis Dominus terram, et quomodo sub judicibus vixerint, vel quae perpessi sint; et iterum, reditur ad judicum ordinem, ab eo qui primus est constitutus.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-iudic2-Dd1e161">
          <head xml:id="gom-iudic2-Hd1e163">Versus 7</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-iudic2-d1e165">
            <quote xml:id="gom-iudic2-Qd1e167" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/iudic2_7@6-7">Et seniorunt.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-iudic2-Rd1e170"><name xml:id="gom-iudic2-Nd1e171" ref="#Origen">ADAMAN.</name>, hom. 1 in Jud.</ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-iudic2-Qd1e175"><seg type="qs">Seniores qui cum Jesu vel post Jesum fuerunt</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">dies vero seniorum sanctorum longaevi sunt <pb ed="#P" n="0522C"/> et prolixi.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-iudic2-Dd1e187">
          <head xml:id="gom-iudic2-Hd1e189">Versus 8</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-iudic2-d1e191">
            <quote xml:id="gom-iudic2-Qd1e193" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/iudic2_8@1-2">Mortuus est.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-iudic2-Rd1e196"><name xml:id="gom-iudic2-Nd1e197" ref="#Origen">ID.</name>, hom. 2.</ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-iudic2-Qd1e201"><seg type="qs">In Paulo vivit Jesus</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">et surrexit generatio altera, quae nesciebat Jesum, etc.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-iudic2-d1e209">
            <ref xml:id="gom-iudic2-Rd1e211" type="lemma" subtype="implied" target="http://scta.info/resource/iudic2_8@1-2"/>
            <ref xml:id="gom-iudic2-Rd1e213"><name xml:id="gom-iudic2-Nd1e214" ref="#Origen">ADAMAN.</name>, hom. 2.</ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-iudic2-Qd1e218"><seg type="qs">Servieruntque Baalim</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">tota anima et totis viribus diligimus; idola adoramus.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-iudic2-Dd1e227">
          <head xml:id="gom-iudic2-Hd1e229">Versus 13</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-iudic2-d1e231">
            <quote xml:id="gom-iudic2-Qd1e233" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/iudic2_13@3-7">Et servierunt Baal et Astartibus.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-iudic2-Rd1e236"><name xml:id="gom-iudic2-Nd1e237" ref="#Augustine">AUG.</name>, quaest. 16 in lib. Judic.</ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-iudic2-Qd1e241"><seg type="qs">Dicitur Baal esse nomen Jovis apud illas gentes</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">Junonem pluraliter memorari voluisse.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-iudic2-d1e249">
            <ref xml:id="gom-iudic2-Rd1e251" type="lemma" subtype="implied" target="http://scta.info/resource/iudic2_13@3-7"/>
            <ref xml:id="gom-iudic2-Rd1e253"><name xml:id="gom-iudic2-Nd1e254" ref="#Augustine">AUG.</name>, quaest. 17.</ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-iudic2-Qd1e258"><seg type="qs">Sed et in psalmo</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">non pretio pecuniario fuerant redimendi.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-iudic2-Dd1e267">
          <head xml:id="gom-iudic2-Hd1e269">Versus 14</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-iudic2-d1e271">
            <quote xml:id="gom-iudic2-Qd1e273" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/iudic2_14">Iratusque Dominus. (ORIG., hom. 2 in <pb ed="#P" n="0522D"/> Jud.)</quote>
            <!-- check: lemma not matched to verse text -->
            <quote xml:id="gom-iudic2-Qd1e280"><seg type="qs">Cum quis Deo servit</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">ne diabolo <pb ed="#P" n="0522D"/> tradamur.</seg></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
